rvice Networking connection / private_network binding&lt;br&gt;Custom-route export and service-range return advertisements&lt;br&gt;Need explicit transport, DNS, security and TLS acceptance" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#759C6C;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n5"><mxGeometry x="100.00" y="650.00" width="1200.00" height="170.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" value="No replication channel, DMS job, import, source data, automatic promotion, DNS cutover or HeatWave capacity exists on the GCP side. Protect both passwords and backups." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="100.00" y="1010.00" width="1200.00" height="80.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No cloud resources; cost and creation/workload flags false. Local metadata guards remain. Separate roots and credentials for each cloud.&lt;br&gt;Native detail pages enumerate every root/module/companion declaration, including private networking, flow logs, IAM and service-specific dependencies.&lt;br&gt;Existing projects/APIs, scoped credentials, region eligibility, quota, supported images/versions, address plans, routes and DNS are explicit prerequisites." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1360.00" width="2940.00" height="160.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="External-source registration / TLS + GTID/binlog compatibility / replication job NOT configured" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize